{
  "comment": "Ep55 Mexico vs Czech Republic (Group A, final matchday, Estadio Azteca). CANON: content/Stories/Mexico-vs-Czech-Republic.md \u2014 'The Diamond of Prague Meets the Aztec Sun'. SPINE: two nations who touched football's summit in 1962, then 64 years of silence; on the final matchday only one survives. Unplayed -> OUR PREDICTION Mexico 1-0 Czech Republic (Schick's 64' shot saved spectacularly by 40-year-old Ochoa \u2014 NO goal, 0-0 holds; Mexico counter, Lozano crosses, Santiago 'Bebelo' Gimenez throws himself at it to score the winner 67' MEX 1-0; Czech eliminated). ONE goal (Gimenez) + one heroic Ochoa SAVE beat (no goal). NO third goal. Monetization-safe: no gambling/odds/prize wording. Legend 055 = The Glassblower (Bohemian crystal \u2014 'the diamond of Prague', Czech's first Legend). vol=0 on every clip (silent reused/AI clips; audio = VO + music + sfx). Atmosphere library: mex-fans, cze-fans, stadium, celebration, action-crowd, mystery-glass + 10 player clips. drama-* point at player/fan/stadium clips for now; parent repoints to action-*.mp4 footage afterward. Brian VO.",
